<title>CHINA: Joyce Boutique year net falls 62.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Joyce Boutique year net falls 62.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   9.7	vs  29.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	vs  8.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    30.21    vs  81.05</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,066.14 vs  992.3</p>
<p>    Company name		 Joyce Boutique Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 18-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Joyce Boutique retails high fashion garments and accessories and publishes magazines.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is three H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs 11.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
